1
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:06,940
Listen,

2
00:00:08,473 --> 00:00:10,163
this isn’t about
charts

3
00:00:10,164 --> 00:00:11,853
or early undeground pets

4
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:19,812
Edging around a
adult man energy

5
00:00:20,393 --> 00:00:23,181
syrupy dots
to the softness

6
00:00:23,716 --> 00:00:25,933
or melodic prettiness

7
00:00:26,722 --> 00:00:27,422
Yeah

8
00:00:28,181 --> 00:00:30,786
You weren’t born
with a “buy” button,

9
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,748
The terminal in swaddles
couldn’t open for you.

10
00:00:34,032 --> 00:00:36,634
There was a call to
become more than you are,

11
00:00:36,695 --> 00:00:38,286
It whispered
in candles,

12
00:00:38,287 --> 00:00:39,876
in shorts, in
every test.

13
00:00:40,612 --> 00:00:43,167
You thought freedom
was here, suddenly,

14
00:00:43,432 --> 00:00:45,048
But the market
is a mirror,

15
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:46,477
a test for
your ears.

16
00:00:46,874 --> 00:00:49,932
Cycles, schemes,
dumps, pullbacks,

17
00:00:50,002 --> 00:00:51,561
In the loop you
lost yourself

18
00:00:51,663 --> 00:00:53,105
- brother, know
these dates.

19
00:00:53,147 --> 00:00:54,579
Not a trader,

20
00:00:54,601 --> 00:00:56,048
not a player -

21
00:00:56,225 --> 00:00:59,118
but alive,

22
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,865
Between the
entry points,

23
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:06,196
an empty heart inside.

24
00:01:06,459 --> 00:01:09,463
Not advice, but
a cry, not tables,

25
00:01:09,963 --> 00:01:13,651
but dreams,

26
00:01:13,723 --> 00:01:14,789
Stay on the path -

27
00:01:15,233 --> 00:01:20,406
something will
awaken within.

28
00:01:34,146 --> 00:01:36,947
Trading isn’t a
profession, it’s a ritual,

29
00:01:37,532 --> 00:01:39,283
Go through hell,
hear the silence -

30
00:01:39,303 --> 00:01:40,436
that’s the signal.

31
00:01:40,735 --> 00:01:43,517
No instructions,
only revelation,

32
00:01:43,557 --> 00:01:45,955
Pain and drawdowns
- your understanding,

33
00:01:45,976 --> 00:01:46,604
 your vision.

34
00:01:46,641 --> 00:01:48,916
You can leave,
but stay with me,

35
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,626
Inside lives the
unbreakable,

36
00:01:51,657 --> 00:01:53,222
 sacred, steadfast.

37
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:56,142
Not a trader,
not a player -

38
00:01:56,151 --> 00:01:59,724
but alive,

39
00:01:59,787 --> 00:02:01,845
Between the
entry points,

40
00:02:02,253 --> 00:02:05,657
an empty heart inside.

41
00:02:06,474 --> 00:02:09,499
Not advice, but
a cry, not tables,

42
00:02:09,882 --> 00:02:13,466
but dreams,

43
00:02:13,554 --> 00:02:15,127
Stay on the path -

44
00:02:15,224 --> 00:02:21,678
something will
awaken within.

45
00:02:34,001 --> 00:02:36,607
You entered the game,
but don’t lose yourself,

46
00:02:36,635 --> 00:02:39,949
Look deep within,
ignite your own light.

47
00:02:39,997 --> 00:02:42,690
Every drawdown,
every entry point -

48
00:02:42,722 --> 00:02:43,236
a lesson,

49
00:02:43,342 --> 00:02:44,391
Every short and long -

50
00:02:44,496 --> 00:02:46,895
a step to your
living mind, brother.

51
00:02:47,511 --> 00:02:49,900
No signals -
there’s only you,

52
00:02:49,979 --> 00:02:51,404
No freedom
in the market,

53
00:02:51,405 --> 00:02:53,244
but there is an
inner temple.

54
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,905
Wake up…

55
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:57,020
hear yourself
between the lines,

56
00:02:57,482 --> 00:03:00,415
In every market noise,
your voice, your current.

57
00:03:01,078 --> 00:03:03,578
This isn’t a
text, it’s a ritual,

58
00:03:03,705 --> 00:03:06,635
Chronicle of life,
inner path - the finale.

59
00:03:08,119 --> 00:03:11,268
Welcome to the
path, here is all yours,

60
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:16,115
No signals -

61
00:03:16,115 --> 00:03:18,115
only the living.

